{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "82f45195-fe75-8225-8d13-aa3e6dc9da48",
  "created_at": "2026-01-23T14:23:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Edson Varela",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:22:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:22:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I am calling about the road. The edge of the road is crumbling at a curve. I have been meaning to call all week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:22:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can take that down. Where is the curve?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:22:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 405 Ocean Avenue, on the Ocean Drive side. Right by the bend there, [line breaks up] the asphalt is breaking off toward the [inaudible]."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:22:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out on me. Breaking off toward the what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:22:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Toward the water side. The edge, it is coming apart in pieces. Some of it is already in the grass."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:22:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So the pavement edge is crumbling right at the curve in front of 405 Ocean Avenue. Is it out in the travel lane at all, or just the shoulder edge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:22:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the edge now. But a car coming around has to go close to it. [pause] Um, [crosstalk] Mi ta papia ku bo na un minutu, nha irmon. Sorry. My brother is asking something. I am back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:23:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I'll send this over to the road crew to have a look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:23:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. One more question. If a car hits that and gets damaged, does the city pay for it? Reimburse the repair?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:23:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's handled as a claim, and I can't say how it would go. If something happens, you'd file it with the city clerk's office. For now I'm just logging the hazard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:23:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I understand. Can I get a reference number for my report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:23:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, hang on. [pause] I'm entering it now. Your reference is going to be on the confirmation, but let me read it slowly once it comes up. Are you still there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:23:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I am here. The line is not so good, so please say it twice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:23:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. I'll give it to you twice, then. Have a pen ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:23:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ready. Go ahead."
    }
  ],
